<h1>OL-Speed Skating: 1000 M KORTBANE Men (Official list), The 1994 Winter Olympics</h1>
<a href=15.html>Previous</a> - <a href=17.html>Next</a>
<p>
Received from NTB at 22:06.
<pre>



Hamar (NTB): Short Track Speed Skating 1000 m Men Tuesday:

Gold: Kim Ki-Hoon, South-Korea,
 Silver: Chae Ji-Hoon, South-Korea,
 Bronze: Marc Gagnon, Canada,
 4) Satoru Terao, Japan,
 5) Lee Jun-Ho, South-Korea. Uplasserte finalister: Derrick Campbell,
 Canada, Nicholas Gooch, United Kingdom, Frederic Blackburn, Canada. A-Final: 1) Kim 1.34,57,
 2) Chae 1.34,92. Disqualified: Gooch. Did not finish: Campbell. B-Final: 1) Gagnon 1.33,03,
 2) Terao 1.33,39,
 3) Lee 1.44,99. Disqualified: Blackburn. Semifinaler,
 1. heat: 1) Kim 1.31,69,
 2) Gooch 1.31,77,
 3) Lee 1.31,93,
 4) Gagnon 2.16,27. 2. heat: 1) Chae 1.31,56,
 2) Campbell 1.36,12,
 3) Blackburn 1.41,71,
 4) Terao 1.43,58. Kvartfinaler,
 1. heat: 1) Chae 1.31,40,
 2) Campbell 1.31,82,
 3) Kieran Hansen, Australia 1.32,34.
 Disqualified: Orazio Fagone, Italy. 2. heat: 1) Lee 1.29,58,
