 3) Andrew Gabel, USA 1.33,59.
 Disqualified: Li Jiajun, China. De to beste fra hvert heat går til semifinale. Qualifying,
 1. heat: 1) Gagnon 1.32,52,
 2) Hansen 1.32,96,
 3) Mirko Vuillermin, Italy 1.33,51,
 4) Bat-Orgil Batchuluun, Mongolia 1.40,41.
 2. heat: 1) Gabel 1.32,32,
